        "### Step 1 — Authenticate & Configure Parameters (~10s) | [![Open In Colab](https://colab.research.google.com/assets/colab-badge.svg)](https://colab.research.google.com/github/luiscuellarh/apigee-unified-ai-gateway/blob/main/00_setup_vpc_and_ip_ranges.ipynb)\n",
        "**Critical Concept:** The reserved `/22` and `/28` are **GLOBAL allocations attached to the NETWORK**, not subdivisions of the subnet. They must not overlap `SUBNET_CIDR`, nothing of yours is ever deployed inside them (they are consumed by the Google-managed Apigee tenant project), and you must **never create a subnetwork inside a reserved range**.\n",
        "```text\n",
        "[VPC: apigee-network] ──► [DEPLOY (regional subnet): 10.10.0.0/24]  |  [RESERVE (global runtime): 10.20.0.0/22]  |  [RESERVE (global support): 10.30.0.0/28]\n",
        "```"
      ]
    },
    {
